    "summary": "Use it in either player's Fight phase, right after an enemy unit picks its targets, on a **DRUKHARI** or **HARLEQUINS** unit of yours that it targeted. Until the phase ends, whenever 1 of your unit's models that has yet to fight this phase is **destroyed**, roll a D6, adding 1 if your unit is currently losing the wager. If the result is 4+:\n\n- the model stays on the battlefield for now\n- it can fight once the enemy unit has made all its attacks\n- it is then removed",
